---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const title = 'Mailbox Atlas';
const description = 'Virtual mailbox prices, scan and forwarding fees, and USPS Form 1583 rules compared, with a source link on every number.';
---
<Base title={title} description={description} updated="2026-11-23">
  <h1>Virtual mailboxes, priced out</h1>
  <p class="lede">What a virtual mailbox really costs once scans, forwarding and the Form 1583 notary are added. Every number is copied from the provider's own page and linked to it.</p>
  <div class="note"><strong>New: <a href="/virtual-mailbox-chooser/">Virtual mailbox chooser</a>.</strong> Enter your mail volume, scans, checks and budget, and see an estimated monthly cost for nine services, ranked.</div>
  <div class="cards">
    <div class="card"><h3><a href="/virtual-mailbox-pricing-comparison/">Pricing compared</a></h3><p>Eight providers: plans, mail allowances, scan and forwarding fees.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3><a href="/cheapest-virtual-mailbox/">The cheapest virtual mailbox</a></h3><p>From $4.99, and when the cheap plan stops being cheap.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3><a href="/usps-form-1583-online-notarization/">Form 1583 &amp; online notary</a></h3><p>What USPS requires, and which providers skip the notary.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3><a href="/traveling-mailbox-vs-postscan-mail/">Traveling Mailbox vs PostScan Mail</a></h3><p>Fee by fee, with a worked monthly example.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3><a href="/ipostal1-vs-anytime-mailbox/">iPostal1 vs Anytime Mailbox</a></h3><p>One national price list vs 2,000+ operator-set plans.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3><a href="/ipostal1-pricing/">iPostal1 pricing explained</a></h3><p>All 12 tiers, address surcharges and every per-use fee.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3><a href="/anytime-mailbox-pricing/">Anytime Mailbox pricing</a></h3><p>Starting prices of all 2,095 U.S. locations, and why they differ.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3><a href="/virtual-mailbox-for-llc/">Virtual mailbox for an LLC</a></h3><p>Registered office vs mailing address, and plans that bundle an agent.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3><a href="/virtual-mailbox-check-deposit-fees/">Check deposit fees</a></h3><p>From free to $10 a check, provider by provider.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3><a href="/earth-class-mail-pricing/">Earth Class Mail pricing</a></h3><p>Now LegalZoom Virtual Mail: five plans and every fee.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3><a href="/stable-vs-earth-class-mail/">Stable vs Earth Class Mail</a></h3><p>For startups: what each costs at 5, 15 and 30 letters.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3><a href="/us-global-mail-vs-traveling-mailbox/">US Global Mail vs Traveling Mailbox</a></h3><p>$65 vs $15 a month, and what the gap buys.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3><a href="/virtual-mailbox-for-rvers/">Mail for full-time RVers</a></h3><p>Virtual mailbox vs USPS Premium Forwarding vs General Delivery.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3><a href="/virtual-mailbox-from-abroad/">Living abroad?</a></h3><p>Form 1583 with a foreign passport, and what each provider requires.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3><a href="/postscan-mail-pricing/">PostScan Mail pricing</a></h3><p>$10 to $65 a month by address, and every per-item fee.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3><a href="/traveling-mailbox-pricing/">Traveling Mailbox pricing</a></h3><p>Basic, Extended or Small Business: when upgrading pays.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3><a href="/virtual-post-mail-pricing/">Virtual Post Mail pricing</a></h3><p>$20 to $90 plans with a free registered agent in 5 states.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3><a href="/virtual-mailbox-for-bank-account/">Virtual mailbox for a bank account?</a></h3><p>Which address fields banks accept a PMB in, and which they don't.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3><a href="/virtual-mailbox-vs-po-box/">Virtual mailbox vs PO Box</a></h3><p>USPS box fees by ZIP, street addressing, and what each can't do.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3><a href="/virtual-mailbox-addresses/">Every address, state by state</a></h3><p>All 2,107 Anytime Mailbox street addresses with each location's starting price, grouped by state and city.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3><a href="/cheapest-virtual-mailbox-by-state/">Cheapest address by state</a></h3><p>TX, FL, DE, WY, CA and NY: the lowest starting price in each, from every listed location.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3><a href="/virtual-mailbox-forwarding-fees/">Mail forwarding fees</a></h3><p>Per shipment vs per item, with a 10-letter example.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3><a href="/virtual-mailbox-storage-fees/">How long mail is kept</a></h3><p>Free storage days for letters and packages, and the fees after.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3><a href="/virtual-office-vs-virtual-mailbox/">Virtual office vs virtual mailbox</a></h3><p>What the extra $300 to $1,000 a year buys.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3><a href="/opus-virtual-offices-vs-davinci/">Opus vs Davinci</a></h3><p>Flat $59/$99 vs per-building pricing with a setup fee.</p></div>
  </div>
</Base>
